<title>UK: Reuters 4th ex-HK to Europe/MidEast air cargo repo.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th ex-HK to Europe/MidEast air cargo repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
